// total case and the same calls compile.
// @falsified-at: 51395d496 — interpret exit 1 -> 0, interpret expectations FAIL/3 -> 0/3 (the suite's verdict, not a count of matches), native exit 1 -> 0, native expectations FAIL/3 -> 0/3 (the suite's verdict, not a count of matches)
// @falsified-by: tests/falsified/an-uncovered-call-is-refused-naming-what-was-passed-and-what-is-declared.patch — interpret exit 1 -> 0, interpret expectations FAIL/3 -> 0/3 (the suite's verdict, not a count of matches), native exit 1 -> 0, native expectations FAIL/3 -> 0/3 (the suite's verdict, not a count of matches)
//   CHANNEL: expectations — on the control the enum-held line is unmet: the call is refused
//   there at the static types (*no definition of `hit` takes (Entity, Entity)*) where here the
//   closed enum is enumerated and the refusal names the first pair no definition takes.
//   (Re-measured at step 13; the earlier receipt, at 0af9e3cfd, pinned the pre-enumeration
//   wording.)  Not leak and not assert.
//   ARMED: no instrument.
